..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : EDIDAT.ME
.. Autor          : dsch
.. Verantwortlich : dsch
.. Kontrolle      :
.. Funktion       : Initialiserung Maskenfelder und Icons
.. Functionality  : initialize start values, define icons
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. Icons definieren
.formula M|ferrorz  = "icon:ball_orange"
.formula M|missingz = G|icokrit
.formula M|unknownz = "icon:stop"
..
.. Farben definieren
.input "is/ABASFARBEN.DEF"
.formula M|colempty = U|xabasmidyellow
.formula M|collength = U|xabaspink
.formula M|colnumeric = U|xabasmidorange
.formula M|colnotempty = U|xabasmidblue
.formula M|collfdnr = U|xabasabaslightgreen2
..
.. not used
.formula M|colversion = "-1 -1 -1"
..
.. Set colours to legend
.colour -background 'M|colnumeric'       legnumeric
.colour -background 'M|colempty'         legempty
.colour -background 'M|colnotempty'      legnotempty
.colour -background 'M|collength'        leglength
.colour -background 'M|collfdnr'         leglfdnr
.colour -background 'M|colversion'       legversion
..
..*****************************************************************************
.continue
